        {
          "id": 15,
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "runs": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "Stone endures where nearly everything else decays. Long after the commanders who ordered their construction have been forgotten, the great fortifications of medieval Europe continue to impose their presence on the landscapes they were built to dominate.",
